             driver and software package for your printer model from=0A    =
                                                the official website and fo=
llow these steps:=0A                                                &lt;/stron=
g&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the=
 Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                   =
                 Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A       =
                                             scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A               =
                                 &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers,=
 then choose the=0A                                                    one =
you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A                     =
                               to remove the printer later, just highlight =
it and=0A                                                    select Remove.=
&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 c=
lass=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                         =
                       &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                         =
           1.Prepare your printer:=0A                                      =
          &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p=
&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer to=0A                    =
                                unpack the printer, install ink or toner, a=
nd add paper.=0A                                                    Turn on=
 the printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A                  =
                                  any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                    =
                            &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                    =
                2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A   =
                                                 came with the printer to c=
onnect it to the network.=0A                                               =
 &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A     =
                                               If you have a Wi-Fi printer,=
 you might need to connect=0A                                              =
      the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A          =
                                          printing. After connecting the pr=
inter to your Mac,=0A                                                    in=
stall the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A                   =
                                 use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant =
to connect the printer=0A                                                  =
  to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A                      =
                              disconnect the cable from your printer and Ma=
c and the=0A                                                    printer sho=
uld remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                              =
                  &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                               =
 &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. Add the =
printer to your list of available printers:=0A                             =
                   &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                         =
       &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    Choose App=
le menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                          =
                          &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may need to scrol=
l=0A                                                    down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A   =
                                             &lt;strong&gt;=0A                   =
                                 4. When your printer appears in the list, =
select your=0A                                                    printer, =
then click Add.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=
=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It may take a =
minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                               =
                     If you see a message prompting you to download new=0A =
                                                   software, make sure to d=
ownload and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                       =
         &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    5. =
If you do not see your printer listed on the left,=0A                      =
                              click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fax button =
on the=0A                                                    right.=0A     =
                                           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                 =
                               &lt;p&gt;=0A                                      =
